# THE GAP — before the illusion platform. Shows if/else on flags and sight.

camera 1790 -300 1.6
if not flag gap_explained
	say fairy "Stop. That ledge out there... it isn't real."
	say mafia "It looks real."
	say fairy "So did the rot on the terraces. Press E. Look with your other eyes."
	set_flag gap_explained
end
if eye Solar
	say fairy "There. The true path glows. Your Solar eye sees what people back home can't."
else
	if eye Lunar
		say mafia "Your eye is open, not mine. I'll trust the glowing one."
	else
		say mafia "Fine. Eyes open, then."
	end
end
camera_reset
